message: "Please cite this research software and the upstream datasets separately."
type: software
title: "Hashtag Neural Lab: connectome-derived task circuits, SO-101 control and tic-tac-toe"
authors:
  - family-names: Özbaş
    given-names: Mert
    affiliation: Hashtag World Company
repository-code: "https://github.com/mertozbas/fruitfly-hashtag"
url: "https://labs.hashtagworldcompany.com"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An open research prototype reusing MaleCNS anatomical subgraphs for learned
  navigation, simulated robot manipulation and tic-tac-toe strategy, with a
  separate bounded physical SO-101 motion case study. Not a whole-brain
  emulation or a language model. The research note is not peer reviewed.
keywords:
  - connectomics
  - robotics
  - SO-101
  - tic-tac-toe
  - MuJoCo
